  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "SNG 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The song of songs, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon's.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let him kiss me with the kisses of his mouth: for thy love",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "better than wine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because of the savour of thy good ointments thy name",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ointment poured forth, therefore do the virgins love thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Draw me, we will run after thee: the king hath brought me into his chambers: we will be glad and rejoice in thee, we will remember thy love more than wine: the upright love thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "black, but comely, O ye daughters of Jerusalem, as the tents of Kedar, as the curtains of Solomon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Look not upon me, because I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "black, because the sun hath looked upon me: my mother's children were angry with me; they made me the keeper of the vineyards;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mine own vineyard have I not kept.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell me, O thou whom my soul loveth, where thou feedest, where thou makest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thy flock",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to rest at noon: for why should I be as one that turneth aside by the flocks of thy companions?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ If thou know not, O thou fairest among women, go thy way forth by the footsteps of the flock, and feed thy kids beside the shepherds' tents.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have compared thee, O my love, to a company of horses in Pharaoh's chariots.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy cheeks are comely with rows",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of jewels",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", thy neck with chains",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of gold",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We will make thee borders of gold with studs of silver.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ While the king",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "sitteth",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "at his table, my spikenard sendeth forth the smell thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bundle of myrrh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my wellbeloved unto me; he shall lie all night betwixt my breasts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My beloved",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto me",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a cluster of camphire in the vineyards of En-gedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fair, my love; behold, thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fair; thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "hast",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "doves' eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fair, my beloved, yea, pleasant: also our bed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "green.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The beams of our house",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.1.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.1.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cedar,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
